Kcpxj7UBl6niw7YFOrvgoCjRJDDJFh7jQ&oe=6AFDDC5A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Lights Out", "keywords": ["horror", "survival", "multiplayer", "coop"], "long_description": "The lights are out and something is hunting you.\n\nLights Out is a round-based co-op survival horror game. Work with up to 8 players to restore power at terminals scattered around a dark facility. Every terminal you hack cuts time off the clock. When it hits zero the exit opens, and anyone who doesn't reach it in time doesn't make it out.\n\nFEATURES\n- A different monster hunts you each round, from towering stilt-limbed giants to statues that only move when unseen. Learn what each one senses, then juke it, hide from it or stun it.\n- Seven terminal puzzles. Fail one and the alarm gives you away.\n- Four maps, including procedurally generated catacombs, warehouses and hospital wings, plus six game modes and four difficulty levels.\n- Caught players have 30 seconds to be revived. Power-ups like EMP charges, shields and noise makers help the team.\n- Proximity voice chat. Your voice is also noise the monster can hear.\n- Built for VR: grab-and-climb movement, jumping, smooth or snap turning, a comfort vignette, seated height offset and reduced flashing options.\n- Host a room and share a four-letter code, or join a friend's. No account needed.\n\nContains horror themes, sudden jump scares and flashing lights.", "short_description": "Survive the monster. Restore the power. Don't leave anyone behind. A co-op horror game for you and your friends: hack terminals, dodge a relentless creature, revive downed teammates and escape the facility before time runs out."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://survive-the-bear.vercel.app/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TezJr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://survive-the-bear.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COM